ent 4698 0 R/Dest[null 0.0 0.0 1.0]/First 4716 0 R/Last 4717 0 R/Next 4712 0 R/Prev 4718 0 R/Title(Es_la_text.pdf)>>endobj4716 0 obj<</Parent 4715 0 R/Dest(G1000339.002)/Next 4747 0 R/Title(VEHÍCULOS EQUIPADOS CON BOLSAS DE AIRE)>>endobj4717 0 obj<</Parent 4715 0 R/Dest(G1000456.000)/Prev 4737 0 R/Title(SERVICIO)>>endobj4718 0 obj<</Parent 4698 0 R/Dest(G1000653)/Next 4715 0 R/Prev 4719 0 R/Title(Foreword)>>endobj4719 0 obj<</Parent 4698 0 R/Dest(G1000456)/Next 4718 0 R/Prev 4720 0 R/Title(SERVICE)>>endobj4720 0 obj<</Count 2/Parent 4698 0 R/Dest(G999662)/First 4721 0 R/Last 4722 0 R/Next 4719 0 R/Prev 4723 0 R/Title(COILED CORD REPLACEMENT)>>endobj4721 0 obj<</Parent 4720 0 R/Dest(G1000473)/Next 4722 0 R/Title(1. Rotate the locking collar at the base of the microphone in a counterclockwise direction until it stops.)>>endobj4722 0 obj<</Parent 4720 0 R/Dest(G1000488)/Prev 4721 0 R/Title(2. Pull the cord out and away from the base of the microphone.)>>endobj4723 0 obj<</Count -6/Parent 4698 0 R/Dest(G1000371)/First 4724 0 R/Last 4725 0 R/Next 4720 0 R/Prev 4726 0 R/Title(MICROPHONE OPERATION)>>endobj4724 0 obj<</Parent 4723 0 R/Dest(G999627)/Next 4736 0 R/Title(1. Hold the microphone approximately five centimeters \(two inches\) from your mouth.)>>endobj4725 0 obj<</Parent 4723 0 R/Dest(G1001042)/Prev 4733 0 R/Title(2. Pull cable from accessory interface connector to release.)>>endobj4726 0 obj<</Count -5/Parent 4698 0 R/Dest(G1000558)/First 4727 0 R/Last 4728 0 R/Next 4723 0 R/Prev 4729 0 R/Title(INSTALLATION)>>endobj4727 0 obj<</Parent 4726 0 R/Dest(G1000367)/Next 4732 0 R/Title(1. Verify that the selected mounting surface is strong enough to support the mounting hardware and the microphone.)>>endobj4728 0 obj<</Parent 4726 0 R/Dest(G1000595)/Prev 4730 0 R/Title(2. Connect the microphones coiled cord plug to the microphone connector on the front of the radio. Align the connector pins then twist outer collar clockwise to lock in place.)>>